cff-version: 1.2.0
title: TEMOA-Europe
message: >-
  If you use TEMOA-Europe in your work, please cite the article
  listed under "preferred-citation" below.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Daniele
    family-names: Lerede
    affiliation: Politecnico di Torino
